# Bubble sort

Run the code. A trace slide appears as a branch (1-1); press Show trace, or Ctrl+Right while presenting.

```python run id=sort
a = [5, 2, 4, 1, 3]
import json
def show(op, hl=()):
    print("@itsd " + json.dumps({"op": op, "a": a[:], "hl": list(hl)}))
show("start")
for i in range(len(a)):
    for j in range(len(a) - 1 - i):
        show("compare", (j, j + 1))
        if a[j] > a[j + 1]:
            a[j], a[j + 1] = a[j + 1], a[j]
            show("swap", (j, j + 1))
show("done")
```

